: The query is incorrect. Glenn Quagmire is voiced by **Alan Tudyk**, and Alan Tudyk is not the creator of any 2012 film.\n\nThus, there is no valid 2012 film created by the person who voiced Glenn Quagmire.\n\nBut if we interpret the query as: \"Glenn Quagmire is voiced by [X], and X is the creator of what 2012 film?\" — then X is not the creator of any 2012 film.\n\nTherefore, the correct response is:\n\n**There is no 2012 film created by the person who voiced Glenn Quagmire.**\n\nFinal answer: **None**.",
